\title{Devices}
\taxon{Definition}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{Some [entities](001C) \em{provide} one or more [capabilities](001D); such entities are known as \em{devices}.  For example, a \tt{branch predictor} device provides the \tt{conditional} capability, which allows robots to evaluate conditional expressions.}
